cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the software, MIMIC-IV v3.1, and the article once published."
title: "Early continuous neuromuscular blockade in severe hypoxemic respiratory failure: target trial emulation code"
abstract: >-
  R code and design documentation for a target trial emulation in MIMIC-IV
  v3.1 comparing initiation of a continuous neuromuscular blocking agent
  infusion within 12 hours of physiological eligibility with no initiation
  during that window. The release includes cohort construction, baseline
  severity enrichment, exact death-time integration, hourly grace-period
  covariates, and the final clone-censor-weight analysis. Code only; no patient
  data are distributed.
type: software
authors:
